      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "After Congress passed the Armed Occupation Act of 1842, the Lyman family settled in 1888, opened store and post office, and incorporated July 20, 1921 with 22 voters.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
