      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lantana%2C_Florida",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "When Interstate 95 was completed through Lantana in the mid‑1970s, commercial development surged.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
