      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lantana%2C_Florida",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "From 1974 to 1988, Lantana hosted the world’s largest decorated Christmas tree, shipped each year by rail to the National Enquirer grounds.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
